Module
  name: test_loottour
  description: TEST ONLY (loot-video.yml, O676) - with the environment variable CHAOS_LOOTTOUR=1 it logs in with the account of CHAOS_LIVE_ACCOUNT / _PASSWORD, enters the game, says the tester helper's loot explosion twice, presses Loot all and exits, so a manual workflow can film it. Without the variable it does nothing, no window, no hotkey, not in the hub menu
  author: Cinders of Chaos
  sandboxed: false
  scripts: [ loottourlogic, loottour ]
  dependencies:
    - client_entergame
  autoload: true
  autoload-priority: 1200
  @onLoad: ChaosLootTour.init()
  @onUnload: ChaosLootTour.terminate()
